By intentionally submitting a contribution for inclusion in the Official
Repository under this license, you represent that you have authority to do so
and grant the Licensors and Authorized Maintainers a non-exclusive, worldwide,
royalty-free copyright license to use, reproduce, modify, and distribute that
contribution as part of the official Dashora Organizer project under this
license, including the commercial permissions described here.

You retain ownership of your contribution. This grant allows maintainers to
review and integrate it and publish official releases; it does not authorize
other users to distribute their own modified versions. Contributions accepted
under separate written terms remain governed by those terms.

